th page with toggle)\n│   └── slices/\n│       ├── authSlice.ts                 (User login/register)\n│       ├── propertiesSlice.ts           (Properties list & filters)\n│       ├── favoritesSlice.ts            (User favorites)\n│       └── amenitiesSlice.ts            (Amenities list)\n├── netlify/functions/\n│   ├── db.ts                            (Neon SQL connection)\n│   ├── auth.ts                          (POST /api/auth)\n│   ├── properties.ts                    (GET/POST /api/properties)\n│   ├── favorites.ts                     (GET/POST/DELETE /api/favorites)\n│   └── amenities.ts                     (GET /api/amenities)\n├── scripts/\n│   └── check.ts                         (Type checking script)\n├── docs/\n│   └── tests.md                         (Comprehensive test spec)\n├── AppSpec.md                           (Product specification)\n├── package.json                         (Dependencies)\n├── tsconfig.json                        (TypeScript config)\n├── vite.config.ts                       (Vite config with React)\n├── netlify.toml                         (Netlify build config)\n├── index.html                           (HTML entry point)\n└── eslint.config.js                     (ESLint config)\n```\n\n---\n\n### AppSpec.md - Full Application Specification\n\nThe application is a **vacation rental marketplace** (Airbnb clone) with complete data models, pages, and API endpoints. Key highlights:\n\n**Data Model:**\n- Users (id, email, name, avatar, bio, phone, is_host, created_at)\n- Properties (id, host_id, title, description, property_type, price_per_night, cleaning_fee, max_guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms, address, city, state, country, coordinates, check-in/out times, is_active)\n- Property Images, Amenities (Essentials, Features, Safety, Location), Property Amenities join table\n- Bookings (property_id, guest_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, total_price, status: pending/confirmed/cancelled/completed)\n- Reviews (booking_id, property_id, guest_id, ratings for: overall, cleanliness, accuracy, communication, location, value)\n- Favorites (user_id, property_id, created_at)\n\n**Pages Specified:**\n1. Login/Register (`/login`) - Email-based, no password\n2. Home/Search (`/`) - Search bar, category filter, property grid, filters panel, pagination\n3. Property Detail (`/properties/:id`) - Image gallery, property info, amenities, booking card, reviews, host info\n4. My Trips (`/trips`) - Upcoming/Past/Cancelled bookings\n5. Host Dashboard (`/hosting`) - Stats, listings, bookings, add listing form\n6. User Profile (`/profile`) - Edit profile, become host option, reviews written\n7. Write Review (`/trips/:bookingId/review`) - Rating sliders and comment\n\n**Design System:**\n- Primary color: #FF5A5F (coral red)\n- Secondary color: #E04E52 (dark red)\n- Light color: #FF787C\n- Status badges: pending (yellow), confirmed (green), cancelled (red), completed (blue)\n- Responsive: 1 col mobile, 2 col tablet, 3-4 col desktop\n- System fonts, rounded cards, subtle shadows\n\n---\n\n### Documentation - tests.md\n\n**Complete test specification** with 200+ test cases covering:\n\n**Auth Tests (Login/Register):**\n- Page defaults to login mode\n- Toggle between modes clears inputs\n- Login validates email format, handles non-existent accounts\n- Register validates name and email, checks duplicate emails\n- Both support repeated use without page reload\n\n**Home Page Tests (Search/Filter/Browse):**\n- SearchBar: location, check-in/check-out, guest count, date validation\n- CategoryFilter: 8 property types (Apartment, House, Cabin, Villa, Condo, Loft, Cottage, Townhouse), single select toggle\n- PropertyGrid: responsive layout, loading states, empty state, pagination\n- PropertyCard: image, type badge, title, location, price, rating with review count\n- FavoriteButton: heart toggle (filled/outline), requires login, prevents card navigation\n- FiltersPanel: price range, bedrooms/beds/bathrooms min selectors, amenities grouped by category, clear all, combine with AND logic\n- Pagination: first/last buttons disabled, page resets on filter change\n\n**Property Detail Tests:**\n- ImageGallery: main + thumbnail grid, click to swap, captions\n- PropertyHeader: title, location, rating (or \"New\"), review count link, host name + avatar\n- PropertyInfo: property type, guest count, bedroom/bed/bathroom counts, check-in/check-out times, singular/plural labels\n- PropertyDescription: full text, \"Show more/less\" toggle for long text\n- AmenitiesList: grouped by category with icons, \"Show all X\" for many amenities\n- BookingCard: price per night, date pickers, guest count, price breakdown (nightly × nights + cleaning fee = total), disabled for own property, sticky on desktop, error for unavailable dates\n- ReviewsSection: average ratings by category, overall rating + count, individual review cards with guest name/avatar/date/rating/comment, ordered by most recent, \"Show all\" for many\n- HostInfoCard: avatar/name/bio/member since date/listing count, placeholder avatar when missing\n\n---\n\n### Frontend Code Architecture\n\n**1. App.tsx** - Simple routing setup\n```\nRoutes:\n  /login → Login page\n  / → Home page\n```\n\n**2. store.ts** - Redux store configuration\n```\nSlices:\n  - auth: currentUser, loading, error\n  - properties: items, filters, totalPages, loading, error\n  - favorites: propertyIds, loading\n  - amenities: items, loading\n```\n\n**3. index.css** - Tailwind + Custom Theme\n```\nColor system with CSS variables:\n  --color-primary: #FF5A5F\n  --color-primary-dark: #E04E52\n  --color-primary-light: #FF787C\n  --color-bg: #FFFFFF\n  --color-bg-secondary: #F7F7F7\n  --color-text: #222222\n  --color-text-secondary: #717171\n  Status colors for pending/confirmed/cancelled/completed\n```\n\n**4. Login Page Components**\n- **AuthToggle**: Props (mode, onToggle) → Renders login/register toggle link\n- **LoginForm**: Email validation, async dispatch loginUser, navigation to home on success\n- **RegisterForm**: Name + email validation, async dispatch registerUser, navigation on success\n- Login page: State management for mode toggle, redirect if already logged in\n\n**5. Home Page Components**\n- **SearchBar**: city, checkIn, checkOut, guests inputs; date min validation; guest min=1; prevent checkout <= checkin\n- **CategoryFilter**: 8 PROPERTY_TYPES as chips; single select toggle (click again deselects)\n- **PropertyGrid**: Maps properties → PropertyCard; loading spinner; empty state message; responsive grid\n- **PropertyCard**: \n  - Displays: main_image, property_type badge, title, city+country, price/night, rating with review_count or \"New\"\n  - Click navigates to /properties/{id}\n  - Embeds FavoriteButton\n- **FavoriteButton**: \n  - Only renders if currentUser exists\n  - Click preventDefault + stopPropagation\n  - Toggles heart fill on isFavorited\n  - Dispatches addFavorite or removeFavorite\n- **FiltersPanel**:\n  - Toggle button expands/collapses panel\n  - Price range: min/max text inputs (decimal)\n  - Bedrooms/Beds/Bathrooms: dropdowns with \"Any\" option + 1-8+\n  - Amenities: grouped by category, checkboxes, multi-select\n  - Buttons: \"Clear all\" (resets), \"Show results\" (applies)\n  - useEffect fetches amenities on first open\n- **Pagination**: \n  - Shows prev/next buttons + page numbers\n  - Smart ellipsis for many pages\n  - Disabled state on first/last page\n  - onPageChange callback\n\n**6. Redux Slices**\n\n**authSlice.ts:**\n```typescript\nUser interface:\n  id, email, name, avatar_url, bio, phone, is_host, created_at\n\nAsync thunks:\n  loginUser(email) → POST /api/auth → returns User\n  registerUser({name, email}) → POST /api/auth → returns User\n\nReducers:\n  logout() → clears currentUser\n  clearError() → clears error\n```\n\n**propertiesSlice.ts:**\n```typescript\nProperty interface:\n  id, host_id, title, description, property_type, price_per_night, \n  cleaning_fee, max_guests, bedrooms, beds, bathrooms, address, city, \n  state, country, latitude, longitude, check_in_time, check_out_time, \n  is_active, created_at, updated_at\n  Optional fields: main_image, avg_rating, review_count (listing view)\n  Detail fields: host_name, host_avatar, host_bio, host_since, \n                 host_listing_count, images[], amenities[], reviews[]\n\nSearchFilters interface:\n  city, checkIn, checkOut, guests: number\n  propertyType, minPrice, maxPrice\n  minBedrooms, minBeds, minBathrooms\n  amenityIds: string[], page: number\n\nAsync thunk:\n  fetchProperties(filters) → GET /api/properties?{params} → \n    Returns {properties[], total, page, totalPages}\n  Params: city, check_in, check_out, guests, property_type, min_price, \n          max_price, min_bedrooms, min_beds, min_bathrooms, amenities, \n          page, limit=12\n\nReducers:\n  setFilters(partialFilters) → merges into state.filters\n  resetFilters() → resets to initialFilters\n  setPage(number) → updates page\n```\n\n**favoritesSlice.ts:**\n```typescript\nState: propertyIds: string[], loading: boolean\n\nAsync thunks:\n  fetchFavorites(userId) → GET /api/favorites?user_id=\n    Returns {property_id}[] array\n  addFavorite({userId, propertyId}) → POST /api/favorites\n  removeFavorite({userId, propertyId}) → DELETE /api/favorites/:propertyId?user_id=\n```\n\n**amenitiesSlice.ts:**\n```typescript\nAmenity interface:\n  id, name, icon, category: \"Essentials\"|\"Features\"|\"Safety\"|\"Location\"\n\nAsync thunk:\n  fetchAmenities() → GET /api/amenities → returns Amenity[]\n```\n\n---\n\n### Backend API Functions (Netlify)\n\n**1. db.ts** - Database connection\n```typescript\nUses @neondatabase/serverless (Neon)\nExports getSql() → returns neon(process.env.DATABASE_URL)\n```\n\n**2. auth.ts** - POST /api/auth\n```typescript\nPOST body: { email, name? }\n- If name present: REGISTER mode\n  - Check if email exists → 409 error\n  - INSERT INTO users (id, email, name, created_at) → gen_random_uuid(), now()\n  - RETURNING * → User object\n- If no name: LOGIN mode\n  - SELECT * FROM users WHERE email\n  - Not found → 404 error\n  - Found → return User object\n```\n\n**3. properties.ts** - GET/POST /api/properties\n```typescript\nGET /api/properties?{filters}\n  Query params: city, check_in, check_out, guests, property_type, \n               min_price, max_price, min_bedrooms, min_beds, \n               min_bathrooms, amenities (comma-separated IDs), \n               page, limit\n  \n  WHERE conditions (AND logic):\n    - p.is_active = true\n    - city filter: LOWER(city) LIKE LOWER('%' || city || '%')\n    - guests: p.max_guests >= guests (if provided)\n    - property_type exact match\n    - price: p.price_per_night >= min_price AND <= max_price\n    - rooms: p.bedrooms >= min_bedrooms, p.beds >= min_beds, \n             p.bathrooms >= min_bathrooms\n    - dates: NOT EXISTS bookings with status in ('confirmed', 'pending')\n             AND overlap check: b.check_in < checkout AND b.check_out > checkin\n    - amenities: COUNT amenities where id IN amenityIds >= array length\n  \n  SELECT fields:\n    - p.*, main_image (first property_images), avg_rating, review_count\n  \n  Pagination: LIMIT limit OFFSET (page-1)*limit\n  \n  Returns: {properties[], total, page, limit, totalPages}\n\nGET /api/properties/:id\n  JOIN users for host_name, host_avatar, host_bio, host_since\n  SELECT COUNT active properties for host_listing_count\n  \n  Includes:\n    - property_images: ordered by display_order\n    - amenities: via property_amenities join, ordered by category+name\n    - reviews: JOIN users for guest_name, guest_avatar, ordered by created_at DESC\n  \n  Returns: property object with all relations\n```\n\n**4. favorites.ts** - GET/POST/DELETE /api/favorites\n```typescript\nGET ?user_id={userId}\n  SELECT property_id, created_at FROM favorites WHERE user_id\n  Returns: [{property_id, created_at}]\n\nPOST body: {user_id, property_id}\n  INSERT INTO favorites (user_id, property_id, created_at)\n  ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING (handles duplicates)\n  Returns: {success: true}\n\nDELETE /:propertyId?user_id={userId}\n  DELETE FROM favorites WHERE user_id AND property_id\n  Returns: {success: true}\n```\n\n**5. amenities.ts** - GET /api/amenities\n```typescript\nGET\n  SELECT * FROM amenities ORDER BY category, name\n  Returns: Amenity[]\n```\n\n---\n\n### Configuration Files\n\n**package.json**\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"airbnb-clone\",\n  \"type\": \"module\",\n  \"scripts\": {\n    \"dev\": \"vite\",\n    \"build\": \"vite build\",\n    \"preview\": \"vite preview\",\n    \"check\": \"tsx scripts/check.ts\",\n    \"test\": \"tsx scripts/test.ts\",\n    \"deploy\": \"tsx scripts/deploy.ts\"\n  },\n  \"dependencies\": {\n    \"@neondatabase/serverless\": \"^0.10.4\",\n    \"@netlify/functions\": \"^2.8.2\",\n    \"@reduxjs/toolkit\": \"^2.5.0\",\n    \"lucide-react\": \"^0.468.0\",\n    \"react\": \"^18.3.1\",\n    \"react-dom\": \"^18.3.1\",\n    \"react-redux\": \"^9.2.0\",\n    \"react-router-dom\": \"^7.1.1\"\n  },\n  \"devDependencies\": [\n    \"@playwright/test\": \"^1.49.1\",\n    \"@replayio/playwright\": \"^3.1.8\",\n    \"vite\": \"^6.0.5\",\n    \"typescript\": \"~5.6.2\",\n    \"@vitejs/plugin-react\": \"^4.3.4\",\n    \"eslint\", \"typescript-eslint\"\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**vite.config.ts**\n```typescript\n- React plugin\n- Path alias: @shared → ../../apps/shared/\n- Build: sourcemap=true, minify=false, process.env.NODE_ENV=\"development\"\n```\n\n**netlify.toml**\n```toml\n[build]\n  base = \"apps/AirbnbClone\"\n  command = \"npm run build\"\n  publish = \"dist\"\n  functions = \"netlify/functions\"\n\n[[redirects]]\n  from = \"/api/*\" → \"/.netlify/functions/:splat\"\n  from = \"/*\" → \"/index.html\" (SPA fallback)\n```\n\n**tsconfig.json**\n```json\n{\n  \"target\": \"ES2020\",\n  \"lib\": [\"ES2020\", \"DOM\", \"DOM.Iterable\"],\n  \"jsx\": \"react-jsx\",\n  \"strict\": true,\n  \"noUnusedLocals\": true,\n  \"noUnusedParameters\": true,\n  \"paths\": {\n    \"@shared/*\": [\"../../apps/shared/*\"]\n  }\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n### Implemented Pages & Routes\n\n**1. Login Page (`/login`)** - IMPLEMENTED\n- AuthToggle (toggle between login/register modes)\n- LoginForm (email input, validation, login)\n- RegisterForm (name + email, validation, register)\n- Redirect to home if already logged in\n\n**2. Home Page (`/`)** - IMPLEMENTED\n- SearchBar (location, check-in, check-out, guests)\n- CategoryFilter (8 property types, single select)\n- PropertyGrid (responsive grid, loading, empty state)\n- PropertyCard (image, badge, title, location, price, rating, favorite button)\n- FiltersPanel (price, rooms, amenities, apply/reset)\n- Pagination (page navigation)\n\n**3. Property Detail Page (`/properties/:id`)** - NOT YET IMPLEMENTED\nPer spec: Image gallery, property header, info, description, amenities, booking card, reviews, host info card\n\n**4. My Trips (`/trips`)** - NOT YET IMPLEMENTED\nPer spec: Upcoming/Past/Cancelled tabs, booking cards, cancel button, write review\n\n**5. Host Dashboard (`/hosting`)** - NOT YET IMPLEMENTED\nPer spec: Stats, listings grid, bookings table, add listing multi-step form\n\n**6. User Profile (`/profile`)** - NOT YET IMPLEMENTED\nPer spec: Edit profile, become host, reviews written\n\n**7. Write Review (`/trips/:bookingId/review`)** - NOT YET IMPLEMENTED\nPer spec: Rating sliders, comment, property context\n\n---\n\n### Key Patterns & Conventions Used\n\n1. **Component Props Interfaces**: All components typed with interfaces\n2. **Data Fetching**: Redux async thunks with createAsyncThunk for all API calls\n3. **Error Handling**: Error state in slices, validation in form components\n4. **Loading States**: Loading booleans in state, conditional rendering with spinners\n5. **Form Validation**: Local state with validation functions (validateEmail, etc.)\n6. **Navigation**: useNavigate() for programmatic navigation after actions\n7. **Styling**: Tailwind CSS with custom color theme variables\n8. **Icons**: lucide-react for all icons (Search, Heart, ChevronLeft/Right, etc.)\n9. **Type Safety**: Full TypeScript with strict mode, custom interfaces for models\n10. **State Management**: Redux with slices for auth, properties, favorites, amenities\n\n---\n\n### Currently Implemented vs. Pending\n\n**COMPLETED:**\n- Login/Register pages with email-based auth\n- Home page with search, category filtering, property grid\n- Property cards with favorites system\n- Advanced filters (price, rooms, amenities)\n- Pagination\n- Redux state management for all implemented features\n- Backend API functions for auth, properties, favorites, amenities\n- Database integration with Neon serverless\n\n**NOT YET STARTED:**\n- Property detail page and all its child components\n- My Trips page and trip management\n- Host dashboard with listing management\n- User profile page\n- Review creation page\n- All booking functionality\n- All remaining API endpoints (bookings, reviews, user profile, etc.)\n- All related test cases for unimplemented features\n\n---\n\n### Absolute File Paths for Reference\n\nKey files:\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/AppSpec.md`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/docs/tests.md`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/App.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/store.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/main.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/index.css`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Login.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/pages/Home.tsx`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/components/*` (11 files)\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/src/slices/*` (4 files)\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify/functions/*` (5 files)\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/package.json`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tsconfig.json`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/vite.config.ts`\n- `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/netlify.toml`\n\nThis comprehensive Airbnb clone application is well-structured with clear separation of concerns, full type safety, and detailed specifications for all planned features. The foundation is solid with implemented authentication, search/filtering, and property browsing capabilities ready for the remaining pages."}],"totalDurationMs":129671,"totalTokens":82832,"totalToolUseCount":52,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":974,"cache_read_input_tokens":76280,"output_tokens":5573,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":974},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"}}}
